# Local wrangler dev vars. This file was tracked from the initial commit until 2026-07-29
# with a live SHOPIFY_API_SECRET in it, on a PUBLIC repo — that secret needs rotating in the
# Shopify Partner dashboard, and it stays in the git history regardless. Never commit this
# file: the Studio integration also expects JWT_SECRET here, which signs every Kadwood
# Studio session for every client.
.dev.vars
